## When to use

Non-trivial multi-step Score Slate work. **Do not** run improve-architecture on the default delivery path.

**Canonical workflow:** [`.agents/skills/feature-delivery/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/feature-delivery/SKILL.md) → [`tdd`](../../.agents/skills/tdd/SKILL.md) → [`delivery-gate`](../../.agents/skills/delivery-gate/SKILL.md).

Entry / tiers: [`.agents/README.md`](../../.agents/README.md).

---

## Quick checklist (see skill for full steps)

1. Declare **tier** (T0–T3) in the plan header.
2. Thin/vague ticket → [`grill-me`](../../.agents/skills/grill-me/SKILL.md) (one question at a time).
3. User stories (incl. ≥1 negative) + Boundary Contract — [`docs/guides/feature-preflight-and-done-gate.md`](../../docs/guides/feature-preflight-and-done-gate.md).
4. Plan under `.cursor/plans/` (**local / gitignored**). Spec check on plan (staff-code-review **Spec axis only**).
5. TDD vertical slices — RED → GREEN; confirm seams before first test when unclear. Follow `.agents/skills/tdd/SKILL.md`.
6. Hand off to [`delivery-gate`](../../.agents/skills/delivery-gate/SKILL.md).

**Go/no-go:** revise plan if Spec critical/high; architecture self-score ≥ 4/5 before coding.

**Plan shape:** Goal + Architecture header; bite-sized RED→GREEN tasks with Files / Steps / Verification. The user commits; no automated commits (same as **Git and destructive operations** in `core.mdc`).

**After all tasks:** full relevant suite + lint. Optional end-of-plan branch review loop → `.cursor/rules/branch-policy.mdc`.

